  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Let incident ray intersecting <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Y</mi><mo>-</mo></math>axis at <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>X</mi><mo>-</mo></math>axis at <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi></math>.<br /><br /><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/937a152e-15a5-4bed-8532-682bdfd8b164-image.png\" style=\"width: 280px; height: 268px;\" /></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8710;</mo><mi>O</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></math> is congruent to <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8710;</mo><mi>O</mi><mi>A</mi><msup><mi>B</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup></math><br /><br />Hence <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>O</mi><msup><mi>B</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>O</mi><mi>B</mi></math><br /><br />Equation of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>B</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mi>A</mi><mo>:</mo><mfrac><mi>x</mi><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mi>y</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math><br /><br />or&nbsp;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></math>.</p>",
